---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-navy-dark border-t border-fg/10 pt-16 pb-10">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 md:gap-10">

    <div class="md:col-span-2">
      <a href="/"><img src="/images/logo-white-04.png" alt="Kugghuset" class="h-8 w-auto" /></a>
      <p class="mt-5 font-body text-sm text-fg/50 leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
        Skräddarsydda BI-miljöer, AI-automationer och systemintegrationer för ekonomichefer och controllers. Vi trollar med data sedan 2013.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-5 font-mono text-xs text-fg/40 space-y-1">
        <p>Sickla Strand 45, 131 34 Nacka</p>
        <p>Org.nr 556934-0531</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-4 mt-5">
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/kugghuset-ab" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="LinkedIn" class="text-fg/40 hover:text-glow transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 8a6 6 0 016 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 00-2-2 2 2 0 00-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 016-6zM2 9h4v12H2z"/><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/kugghuset" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Facebook" class="text-fg/40 hover:text-glow transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18 2h-3a5 5 0 00-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 011-1h3z"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-fg/30 mb-4">Sidor</p>
      <ul class="space-y-2.5 font-body text-sm text-fg/60">
        <li><a href="/kundcase" class="hover:text-fg transition-colors">Kundcase</a></li>
        <li><a href="/artiklar" class="hover:text-fg transition-colors">Artiklar</a></li>
        <li><a href="/vad-ar-en-bi-konsult" class="hover:text-fg transition-colors">Vad är en BI-konsult?</a></li>
        <li><a href="/om-kugghuset" class="hover:text-fg transition-colors">Om oss</a></li>
        <li><a href="/en-timme-gratis-bikonsultation" class="hover:text-fg transition-colors">Gratis BI-timme</a></li>
        <li><a href="/dataskyddspolicy-kugghuset" class="hover:text-fg transition-colors">Dataskyddspolicy</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-fg/30 mb-4">Kontakt</p>
      <ul class="space-y-2.5 font-body text-sm text-fg/60">
        <li><a href="tel:+46704545531" class="hover:text-fg transition-colors">+46 704 545 531</a></li>
        <li><a href="mailto:info@kugghuset.se" class="hover:text-fg transition-colors">info@kugghuset.se</a></li>
      </ul>
      <a
        href="/en-timme-gratis-bikonsultation"
        class="mt-6 inline-block border border-glow text-glow font-mono text-xs tracking-widest uppercase px-4 py-2.5 hover:bg-glow hover:text-navy-dark transition-all"
      >
        Boka gratis →
      </a>
