  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-fg/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between gap-2">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs text-fg/25">© {year} Kugghuset AB</p>
    <p class="font-mono text-xs text-fg/25">Power BI & AI · Business Intelligence · Stockholm</p>
